cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "EarthSystem: earthing system design for homes, buildings, substations and power plants"
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Roshandel
    given-names: Emad
    orcid: ""
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/emadroshandel/earthsystem"
abstract: >-
  An open-source earthing (grounding) system design application implementing
  IEEE Std 80, IEC 60364-4-41 and -5-54, IEC 62305-3, IEC 60909 and IEEE Std
  142, with a boundary-element numerical solver for arbitrary electrode
  geometry in uniform or two-layer soil, and a bilingual design-report
  generator. Runs locally as a desktop or browser application, or entirely in
  the browser via Pyodide.
keywords:
  - earthing
  - grounding
  - IEEE 80
  - IEC 60364
  - IEC 62305
  - boundary element method
  - power systems
